⚡🇸🇩🇪🇹 The RSF and their allies have captured the city of Qaysan on the sudan-ethiopia border. This event is significant as Qaysan is fully surrounded by either Ethiopian territory or SAF (Sudanese armed forces) controlled territory, meaning that for the RSF to reach Qaysan they must have cooperated with Ethiopia.

This could be considered as a major escalation and another step down in the Ethiopian-Sudanese relations. Sudan has yet to issue a statement but we will keep you updated.

